        "imgDesc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "One of the modules for the Pioneer Source Structure that continuously patrols a fixed path. Be warned that creatures touched by its probing beams will be teleported to a specific location, so <color=#ffe04b>use cover to avoid these beams</color> .\nIt was not originally designed as a means of obstruction. Rather, it was meant to get wounded personnel to safety as quickly as possible."
